<title>PORTUGAL: P. Telecom climbs on Telefonica deal.</title>
<headline>P. Telecom climbs on Telefonica deal.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Portugal Telecom rose sharply on Tuesday on news reports, subsequently confirmed, of a share exchange with Spain's Telefonica.</p>
<p>The stock was up 140 escudos at 6,270 and dealers said that it could soon target the all-time high of 6,650 set last month.</p>
<p>&quot;PT is heading for its record highs, not today, but in the short term that is the direction,&quot; said one trader.</p>
</text>
